        <dl class="ledger">
          <div class="ledger__row">
            <dt class="ledger__term">Beyond the Scoreboard</dt>
            <dd class="ledger__def">Success isn't defined by quick wins but by long-term consistency, preparation, and discipline. Drawing on sports analogies and examples from athletes like Kobe Bryant, this talk explores how steady progress&mdash;not immediate outcomes&mdash;leads to lasting success in business and life.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="ledger__row">
            <dt class="ledger__term">The Power of Storytelling in Business</dt>
            <dd class="ledger__def">How effective storytelling transforms sales and marketing strategy: the biological impact of storytelling, how to craft compelling narratives, and practical tips for integrating storytelling into your business framework.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="ledger__row">
            <dt class="ledger__term">Humor in Storytelling</dt>
            <dd class="ledger__def">The art of humorous storytelling and how to use humor to captivate and entertain&mdash;humor mechanics, character and setting development, and performance techniques for a memorable, laughter-filled presentation.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="ledger__row">
            <dt class="ledger__term">Building a Brand That Lasts</dt>
            <dd class="ledger__def">The power of core values in shaping your personal brand&mdash;how to define yours and use them as the foundation for a brand that's authentic, impactful, and enduring.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="ledger__row">
            <dt class="ledger__term">Creating Content that Resonates</dt>
            <dd class="ledger__def">How to develop content strategies that promote organic growth and engage your audience&mdash;messaging and positioning that keeps your content aligned with your brand.</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

